{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57175","headline":"大乘赞十首 五 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道不由行得，说行权爲凡愚。\n得理返观於行，始知枉用功夫。\n未悟圆通大理，要须言行相扶。\n不得执他知解，回光返本全无。\n有谁解会此说，教君向己推求。\n自见昔时罪过，除却五欲疮疣。\n解脱逍遥自在，随方贱卖风流。\n谁是发心买者，亦得似我无忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}